7 9-2-2302. Legislative declaration.
8
9 (b) It is the purpose of this article to promote,
10 preserve and enhance Wyoming's unique cultural heritage by
11 creating a Wyoming cultural trust fund administered by a
12 trust fund board to coordinate public and private donations
13 and manage the distribution of the investment earnings
14 monies from the Wyoming cultural trust fund.
15
