6 9-2-2307. Disbursement of grants.
7
8 (a) Subject to approval of applications from
9 nonprofit and governmental cultural, historical and arts
10 organizations, the board may award grants from the income
11 account to promote, preserve and enhance the unique
12 cultural heritage of Wyoming and its people.
13
14 (b) The board shall have the discretion in
15 determining the amount of money under each grant, except
16 that no grant shall be the total amount of grants awarded
