18 (a) A trust account is created to be known as the
19 Wyoming wildlife and natural resource trust account. The
20 trust account shall consist of those funds designated to
21 the account by law and all monies received from federal
22 grants and other contributions, grants, gifts, transfers,
23 bequests and donations to the trust account. The trust
